<title>USA: Atrix Laboratories Q3 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Atrix Laboratories Q3 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months</p>
<p>							Ended September 30</p>
<p>							     1996	1995</p>
<p> Total revenue				     965,685    417,642</p>
<p> NET LOSS				     (2,442,514) (5,960,742)</p>
<p> NET LOSS PER COMMON SHARE			(0.22)     (0.76)</p>
<p> WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING    11,083,217  7,883,307</p>
<p>						    For the Nine Months</p>
<p>						     Ended September 30</p>
<p>						    1996		 1995</p>
<p> Total revenue				   1,961,199  1,206,999</p>
<p> NET LOSS				    (7,851,903) (10,039,505)</p>
<p> NET LOSS PER COMMON SHARE			(0.80)     (1.28)</p>
<p> WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING     9,832,847  7,857,419</p>
<p>The company's full name is Atrix Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
